OL,3,GNEWSANoel Gallagher says Johnny Marr
OL,4,Ahas 'always been gung-ho' with his
OL,5,Aguitars
OL,6,
OL,7,FNoel Gallagher has said singer Johnny
OL,8,FMarr has "always been a bit gung-ho"
OL,9,Fwith his guitars.
OL,11,FMarr, 62, is to auction almost 100 of
OL,12,Fhis guitars, including one he once sent
OL,13,Fto Oasis that left Gallagher worried it
OL,14,Fcould be damaged
OL,16,FThe Smiths musician said he was letting
OL,17,Fgo of his guitars because, "I didn't
OL,18,Flike the idea of my studio space
OL,19,Fbecoming a museum".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
